#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:98
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With Konqueror you have your filesystem at your command, browsing local or "
"networked drives with equal ease. Thanks to the component technology used "
"throughout KDE, Konqueror is also a full featured, easy to use and "
"comfortable Web Browser, which you can use to explore the Internet."
msgstr ""
"met konqueror jy het jou lêersisteem na jou opdrag, blaaiïng plaaslike of "
"netwerk aandrywers] met gelyk maklikheid. bedankinge aan die komponent "
"tegnologie gebruik word regdeur kde 2, konqueror is asook 'n volgrote "
"fuksionele, maklike aan gebruik en gemaklik web blaaier, wat jy kan gebruik "
"aan ondersoek die internet."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:103
msgid ""
"Simply enter the Internet address (e.g. <A "
"HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>"
") of the web page you want and press Enter, or choose one of the entries in "
"your Bookmarks menu."
msgstr ""
"eenvoudig invoer die internet adres (e.g. <'n "
"<-invoer->HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</'n><-invoer->"
") van die web bladsy jy wil hê en druk invoer, van kies een van die "
"inskrywings in <-invoer->jou boekmerke kieslys."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:106
msgid ""
"If you want to go back to the previous web page, press the button <IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp;(\"Back\") in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"as jy wil hê aan gaan terug aan die vorige web bladsy, druk die knoppie "
"<IMG wydte=16 hoogte=16 src=\"%1\"> &nbsp;(\"terug\") in die nutsbalk."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:109
msgid ""
"To go back to the home directory of your local filesystem press <IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; (\"Home\"). "
msgstr ""
"aan gaan terug aan die huis gids van jou plaaslike lêersisteem druk <IMG "
"wydte=16 hoogte=16 src=\"%1\"> &nbsp; (\"huis\"). "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:111
msgid "For more detailed documentation on Konqueror click <A HREF=\"%1\">here</A>."
msgstr ""
"vir meer gedetaileerde dokumentasie op konqueror kliek <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">hier</A>."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:113
msgid ""
"<I>Tuning Tip:</I> If you want the Konqueror web browser to start faster, "
"you can turn off this information screen by clicking <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">here</A>. You can re-enable it by choosing the Help ->"
" Konqueror Introduction menu option, and then pressing Window -> Save View "
"Profile \"Web Browsing\"."
msgstr ""
"<I>instel leidraad:</I> as jy wil hê die konqueror web blaaier aan begin "
"vinniger, jy kan skakel af hierdie informasie skerm deur te kliek <'n "
"HREF=\"%1\">hier</'n>. jy kan re-enable dit deur kies die hulp -> konqueror "
"inleiding kieslys opsie, en dan word gedruk venster -> stoor besigtig "
"profiel \"web blaaiïng\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:141
msgid ""
"Konqueror is designed to embrace and support Internet standards. The aim is "
"to fully implement the officially sanctioned standards from organizations "
"such as the W3 and OASIS, while also adding extra support for other common "
"usability features that arise as de facto standards across the Internet. "
"Along with this support, for such functions as favicons, Internet Keywords, "
"and <A HREF=\"%1\">XBEL bookmarks</A>, Konqueror also implements:"
msgstr ""
"konqueror is ontwerp aan omhels en ondersteun internet standaarde. die mik "
"is aan volledig implementeer die amptelik sanksie standaarde van "
"organisasies soos as die w3 en oase, terwyl asook bygesit addisionele "
"ondersteun vir ander gemeenskaplike bruikbaarheid funksies wat verrys as de "
"facto standaarde oor die internet. en met hierdie ondersteun, vir soos "
"funksies as gunsteling ikone, internet sleutelwoorde, en <A HREF=\"%1\">"
"xbel boekmerke</A>, konqueror asook implementeer:"

