#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:211
msgid ""
"Use Internet-Keywords and Web-Shortcuts! By typing \"gg: KDE\" one can "
"search the Internet, using Google, for the search phrase \"KDE\". There are "
"alot of Web-Shortcuts predefined to make searching for software or looking "
"up certain words in an encyclopedia a breeze. You can even <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">create your own</A> Web-Shortcuts!"
msgstr ""
"gebruik internet-Keywords en Web-Shortcuts! deur te tik \"gg: kde\" een kan "
"soektog die internet, te gebruik google, vir die soektog frase \"kde\". daar "
"word baie van Web-Shortcuts vooraf gedefinieerde aan maak soek vir sagteware "
"of besig om te soek begin sekere woorde in 'n enseklopedie 'n brisie. jy kan "
"al <'n HREF=\"%1\">skep jou eie</'n> Web-Shortcuts!"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:216
msgid ""
"Use the magnifier button <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in the "
"toolbar to increase the font size on your web page."
msgstr ""
"gebruik die vergroter knoppie <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in "
"die nutsbalk aan vermeerder die skrif tipe grootte op jou web bladsy."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:218
msgid ""
"When you want to paste a new address into the Location toolbar you might "
"want to clear the current entry by pressing the black arrow with the white "
"cross &nbsp;<IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"wanneer jy wil hê aan plak 'n nuwe adres binnein die ligging nutsbalk jy "
"dalk wil hê aan maak skoon die huidige inskrywing deur gedruk die swart pyl "
"met die wit kruis &nbsp;<IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in die "
"nutsbalk."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:222
msgid ""
"To create a link on your desktop pointing to the current page, simply drag "
"the \"Location\" label that is to the left of the Location toolbar, drop it "
"on to the desktop, and choose \"Link\"."
msgstr ""
"aan skep 'n skakel op jou werkskerm aanwys aan die huidige bladsy, eenvoudig "
"trek die \"ligging\" etiket wat is aan die links van die ligging nutsbalk, "
"laat val dit op aan die werkskerm, en kies \"skakel\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:225
msgid ""
"You can also find <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; \"Full-Screen "
"Mode\" in the Window menu. This feature is very useful for \"Talk\" sessions."
msgstr ""
"jy kan asook soek <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; \"vol-skerm "
"modus\" in die venster kieslys. hierdie funksie is baie bruikbare vir "
"\"praat\" sessies."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:228
msgid ""
"Divide et impera (lat. \"Divide and conquer\") - by splitting a window into "
"two parts (e.g. Window -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; Split "
"View Left/Right) you can make Konqueror appear the way you like. You can "
"even load some example view-profiles (e.g. Midnight Commander), or create "
"your own ones."
msgstr ""
"deel et impera (latyn. \"deel en verower\") - deur om te skei 'n venster "
"binnein twee dele (e.g. venster -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> "
"&nbsp; skei besigtig links/regterkant) jy kan maak konqueror verskyn die weg "
"jy hou van. jy kan al las sommige voorbeeld besigtig-profiles (e.g. "
"middernag kommandeur), of skep jou eie ene."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:233
msgid ""
"Use the <A HREF=\"%1\">user-agent</A>"
" feature if the website you're visiting asks you to use a different browser "
"(and don't forget to send a complaint to the webmaster!)"
msgstr ""

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:236
msgid ""
"The <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; History in your SideBar "
"ensures that you can keep track of the pages you have visited recently."
msgstr ""
"die <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; geskiedenis in jou kantbalk "
"maak seker wat jy kan hou navolg van die bladsye jy het besoekte onlangse."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:238
msgid "Use a caching <A HREF=\"%1\">proxy</A> to speed up your Internet connection."
msgstr ""
"gebruik 'n kasberging <'n HREF=\"%1\">volmag</'n> aan spoed begin jou "
"internet verbinding."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:240
msgid ""
"Advanced users will appreciate the Konsole which you can embed into "
"Konqueror (Window -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; Show "
"Terminal Emulator)."
msgstr ""
"gevorderde gebruikers sal waardeer die konsole wat jy kan inbed binnein "
"konqueror (venster -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; vertoon "
"terminaal emulasie)."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:243
msgid ""
"Thanks to <A HREF=\"%1\">DCOP</A> you can have full control over Konqueror "
"using a script."
msgstr ""
"bedankinge aan <'n HREF=\"%1\">dcop</'n> jy kan het volgrote kontrole bo "
"konqueror te gebruik 'n skrip."

